SUMMARY:Norristown Farm Park
DESCRIPTION:Walking Tails\nWe will be meeting at the Main Visitor's Center
  parking lot. See the attached map .pdf for directions. Please RSVP if you
  intend to come on this walk. This walk is ~2-3 miles long and will be on 
 a paved surface. Dogs must be leashed at all times. Don't forget water and
  pooh bags! If you need to cancel\, please either change your RSVP so that
  we do not wait for you to show up. We will leave the parking lot at 10am.
